{"branch":"광장점","html":"<p class=\"kd-intro\">광장점의 위치와 주변 교통편을 확인하세요.</p><div class=\"kd-map-slot\" data-kakao-src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-9b0256c41b96776a.html\" style=\"height:398px\"><p class=\"kd-map-pending\" role=\"status\">위치 지도를 준비하고 있습니다.</p><template><iframe class=\"kd-map-frame\" width=\"640\" height=\"398\" style=\"height:398px\" loading=\"lazy\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" title=\"광장점 카카오맵 지도\" src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-9b0256c41b96776a.html\"></iframe></template></div><noscript><style>.kd-map-slot{display:none}</style><p class=\"kd-note\">위의 지도 이미지와 아래 주소를 기준으로 위치를 확인해 주세요.</p></noscript><p class=\"kd-address\"><strong>주소</strong><span>서울 광진구 광나루로 584 동서울빌딩 5층</span></p><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 지하철</h3><ul class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-line\">수도권 2호선</span><span>구의역</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-line\">수도권 2호선</span><span>강변역</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-line\">수도권 5호선</span><span>광나루역</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 정류장</h3><ol class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-number\">1</span><span>광장동금호베스트빌</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">2</span><span>광장동금호베스트빌</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">3</span><span>광장자이아파트</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">4</span><span>광장자이아파트</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">5</span><span>청구아파트앞</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">6</span><span>래미안구의파크스위트사거리</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">7</span><span>청구아파트앞</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">8</span><span>래미안구의파크스위트사거리</span></li></ol></div><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 버스</h3><dl class=\"kd-buses\"><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">간선</span></dt><dd><span>302</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">지선</span></dt><dd><span>3220</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">마을</span></dt><dd><span>광진01</span></dd></div></dl></div><p class=\"kd-note\">주변 교통정보는 제공된 카카오맵 자료 기준입니다. 운행·정차 정